WEBVTT

01:29.310 --> 01:34.310
[Never-Ending Summer]

01:35.740 --> 01:37.860
[Episode 13]

01:40.940 --> 01:41.780
Lu Xixiao.

01:43.620 --> 01:44.450
You know what?

01:47.450 --> 01:48.700
My dad told me that

01:51.370 --> 01:52.450
kind people

01:53.450 --> 01:54.890
always go to heaven.

01:58.370 --> 01:59.370
I believe your mother

01:59.370 --> 02:00.700
is definitely up there,

02:01.860 --> 02:02.860
watching over you

02:03.940 --> 02:05.200
and accompanying you.

02:16.690 --> 02:17.320
Forget it.

02:21.780 --> 02:22.810
If she saw me like this,

02:22.810 --> 02:25.070
she would probably be even more unhappy.

02:25.820 --> 02:26.820
No, she wouldn't.

02:44.360 --> 02:45.170
She wouldn't.

02:49.780 --> 02:51.060
She wouldn't.

02:52.440 --> 02:53.440
She wouldn't.

02:57.960 --> 02:59.010
She wouldn't.

03:03.570 --> 03:04.410
She wouldn't.

03:04.810 --> 03:06.970
I'm flying higher and higher, Zhou Wan.

03:06.970 --> 03:07.740
How is it?

03:08.530 --> 03:10.220
It's a bit too high, Zhou Wan.

04:29.620 --> 04:30.660
Are you hungry?

04:37.740 --> 04:38.740
I'll cook for you.

04:41.540 --> 04:42.250
Okay.

04:44.270 --> 04:44.930
Okay.

04:48.810 --> 04:49.450
Let's go.

05:52.690 --> 05:53.280
Let's go.

06:27.300 --> 06:28.500
What are you doing...

06:29.670 --> 06:30.730
What are you doing?

06:31.100 --> 06:31.810
Nothing.

06:33.500 --> 06:35.130
Don't just watch. Come here.

06:35.130 --> 06:36.590
I'll teach you how to cook.

06:37.610 --> 06:39.280
Teach me how to cook?

06:40.250 --> 06:41.190
With my skills,

06:42.300 --> 06:44.100
I can only cook instant noodles.

06:46.090 --> 06:47.350
And wash the potato.

06:48.659 --> 06:49.120
Well...

06:54.130 --> 06:54.860
Are you okay?

06:55.270 --> 06:55.960
Well.

06:56.680 --> 06:57.810
It's fine. I'm okay.

06:57.810 --> 07:00.140
I used to hit my head here
all the time, too.

07:19.130 --> 07:20.730
What? You want me to feed you?

07:31.100 --> 07:31.810
Is it hot?

07:32.250 --> 07:33.770
Why not eat later?

07:33.800 --> 07:35.010
Let it cool down first.

07:35.010 --> 07:37.210
It's delicious. Eat it while it's warm.

07:37.740 --> 07:39.140
Five dishes and one soup.

07:39.570 --> 07:40.330
In our family,

07:40.330 --> 07:42.390
this is a New Year's Eve dinner level.

07:49.810 --> 07:50.690
What's up?

07:53.450 --> 07:54.100
Nothing.

07:56.420 --> 07:57.950
It just feels a bit strange.

08:00.330 --> 08:00.810
For so many years,

08:00.810 --> 08:02.410
I've been living here alone.

08:04.010 --> 08:04.770
Now it finally feels a bit

08:04.770 --> 08:05.660
like home.

08:09.810 --> 08:12.270
I only know how to cook home-style dishes.

08:13.570 --> 08:14.970
After you go abroad,

08:15.250 --> 08:17.250
you can cook

08:17.250 --> 08:18.650
these dishes to get full.

08:19.540 --> 08:20.330
Try it.

08:35.059 --> 08:35.850
How is it?

08:40.730 --> 08:41.960
How does it taste?

08:43.610 --> 08:44.380
These are probably

08:44.380 --> 08:45.910
the best ribs I've ever had.

08:46.330 --> 08:47.420
Come on.

08:48.940 --> 08:49.490
I mean it.

08:50.970 --> 08:52.700
Ms. Chen also made this before.

08:53.570 --> 08:54.730
But hers was

08:55.330 --> 08:56.240
a bit sweeter.

08:57.260 --> 08:58.660
Yours is perfect.

09:05.330 --> 09:05.850
Did you remember

09:05.850 --> 09:07.060
my cooking steps?

09:14.260 --> 09:16.380
I've firmly memorized

09:16.380 --> 09:18.510
all the key points Ms. Zhou mentioned.

09:23.850 --> 09:25.650
It's fine if you don't remember.

09:25.850 --> 09:26.380
At that time,

09:26.380 --> 09:28.580
you can also search for recipes online.

09:29.060 --> 09:30.140
As for cooking,

09:30.540 --> 09:32.660
if you watch and practice more,

09:33.090 --> 09:33.900
eventually,

09:33.900 --> 09:35.300
practice makes perfect.

09:37.570 --> 09:38.660
But you're going to study abroad.

09:38.660 --> 09:39.260
There must be

09:39.260 --> 09:40.850
many delicious restaurants.

09:40.850 --> 09:41.210
By then,

09:41.210 --> 09:43.410
you definitely won't want to eat these.

09:53.660 --> 09:54.450
I won't.

10:00.570 --> 10:01.180
I won't forget

10:01.180 --> 10:02.310
the meal you cooked.

10:10.850 --> 10:11.540
Eat.

10:11.940 --> 10:13.670
It's really delicious. Try it.

10:17.210 --> 10:18.470
Try the chicken wings.

10:28.850 --> 10:30.710
I still think the ribs are better.

10:30.970 --> 10:33.100
Why do I think they taste equally good?

10:33.780 --> 10:35.040
They're equally good.

10:41.060 --> 10:42.360
Do you need my help?

10:44.780 --> 10:46.060
Go take a seat.

10:46.330 --> 10:47.180
Go to the sofa.

10:48.380 --> 10:49.020
Sit tight.

10:50.140 --> 10:51.020
I'll be quick.

10:51.850 --> 10:52.540
Sit.

10:53.570 --> 10:54.260
The rag.

11:12.660 --> 11:14.370
Why do you want to go abroad?

11:18.020 --> 11:19.610
Can't you stay and paint?

11:25.140 --> 11:25.810
No.

11:27.450 --> 11:28.060
But didn't you

11:28.060 --> 11:29.590
really like Professor Qin?

11:31.450 --> 11:32.490
I don't believe

11:33.380 --> 11:34.780
you gave up

11:34.780 --> 11:35.730
for no reason.

11:40.060 --> 11:42.460
Because that's
just the kind of person I am.

11:43.660 --> 11:45.190
What about the motorcycle?

11:46.490 --> 11:47.690
You tried so hard

11:47.690 --> 11:48.970
to borrow my notes back then

11:48.970 --> 11:50.260
for the motorcycle.

11:50.940 --> 11:52.020
Why did you sell it?

11:58.850 --> 12:00.910
Because I want you to have a good life.

12:02.020 --> 12:03.020
I want to help you.

12:04.450 --> 12:05.380
This is all

12:06.300 --> 12:07.330
I can do for you.

12:16.140 --> 12:17.400
I don't need your help.

12:19.570 --> 12:21.500
I just want you to be safe and happy.

12:25.540 --> 12:26.780
Only if you live well

12:27.850 --> 12:28.850
can I be safe

12:29.810 --> 12:30.780
and happy.

12:59.540 --> 13:01.340
You like looking at them so much.

13:05.260 --> 13:06.390
After I leave,

13:06.570 --> 13:07.770
I'll give you the key.

13:08.420 --> 13:10.280
You can come and take care of them.

13:12.180 --> 13:13.090
Anyway,

13:13.780 --> 13:14.540
if you miss them,

13:14.540 --> 13:15.800
just come and see them.

13:16.660 --> 13:17.910
If you can come,

13:19.260 --> 13:21.590
that's much better than Jiang Fan coming.

13:24.660 --> 13:25.490
Don't worry.

13:26.540 --> 13:28.800
I will definitely take good care of them.

13:32.020 --> 13:33.180
It's a pity that

13:34.090 --> 13:36.090
you'll be leaving when summer ends.

13:37.260 --> 13:37.940
There are no festivals

13:37.940 --> 13:39.800
to celebrate this summer either.

13:40.780 --> 13:41.850
So boring.

14:16.010 --> 14:17.270
There will be chances.

14:19.260 --> 14:20.020
But what if

14:20.020 --> 14:21.450
we don't get the chance to meet?

14:21.450 --> 14:22.940
I'll give you

14:22.970 --> 14:24.320
every holiday blessing

14:25.300 --> 14:26.420
in advance.

14:29.940 --> 14:31.860
For example?

14:33.810 --> 14:35.340
Happy New Year, Lu Xixiao.

14:36.850 --> 14:38.540
Merry Christmas, Zhou Wan.

14:40.540 --> 14:41.940
Happy Dragon Boat Festival.

14:41.940 --> 14:42.900
Happy Labor Day.

14:43.660 --> 14:44.660
Happy Mid-Autumn Festival.

14:44.660 --> 14:46.610
Happy Women's Day.

14:50.970 --> 14:51.810
Happy National Day.

14:51.810 --> 14:53.140
Happy Spring Festival.

14:53.260 --> 14:55.140
I already said that. It doesn't count.

14:55.140 --> 14:55.850
When did you say that?

14:55.850 --> 14:56.850
Happy New Year.

14:56.940 --> 14:58.060
Happy New Year and Happy Spring Festival.

14:58.060 --> 14:59.260
Happy New Year's Day.

15:02.540 --> 15:03.570
Happy Knee Joint.

15:04.610 --> 15:05.610
You're cheating.

15:06.060 --> 15:07.300
Happy Bow.

15:07.730 --> 15:09.140
Happy Chinese Knot.

15:11.660 --> 15:12.990
Happy Valentine's Day.

15:17.940 --> 15:19.140
Happy Qixi Festival.

15:30.970 --> 15:31.780
Lu Xixiao,

15:34.380 --> 15:37.110
I hope you are not only happy
during the holidays.

15:37.780 --> 15:38.690
I hope you are

15:39.570 --> 15:42.140
safe and happy every day.

15:45.330 --> 15:46.790
Do whatever you want to do.

15:47.540 --> 15:48.600
Follow your heart.

15:49.260 --> 15:50.320
Be unconstrained.

15:50.780 --> 15:51.610
Be free.

15:52.570 --> 15:54.300
Become the adult you want to be.

16:05.940 --> 16:06.490
Okay.

16:10.300 --> 16:10.810
I haven't shown you

16:10.810 --> 16:12.010
around the house yet.

16:13.090 --> 16:14.690
I am going to give you the key.

16:15.260 --> 16:15.780
I should take you

16:15.780 --> 16:17.110
to have a good look at it.

16:25.180 --> 16:25.730
Let's go.

17:19.940 --> 17:21.770
So, this is what it looks like

17:22.900 --> 17:24.430
when they are put together.

17:39.380 --> 17:41.310
That painting isn't finished yet.

17:55.580 --> 17:56.900
Your mother

17:58.820 --> 17:59.900
really loved you.

18:04.580 --> 18:06.110
It's just that at that time,

18:06.660 --> 18:08.720
she might have been trapped in a cage.

18:09.420 --> 18:10.820
She couldn't break free,

18:11.380 --> 18:13.510
and couldn't see you outside the cage.

18:14.860 --> 18:15.860
That's why she made

18:15.860 --> 18:16.790
such a decision.

18:52.770 --> 18:53.420
Zhou Wan.

18:57.250 --> 18:59.110
Do you want to be in a relationship

19:01.250 --> 19:01.860
with me?

19:21.360 --> 19:22.940
♪ If you had ever seen the fireflies ♪

19:24.500 --> 19:26.180
♪ Inside my eyes ♪

19:29.300 --> 19:31.110
♪ I think you would understand ♪

19:32.710 --> 19:35.020
♪ Why I embrace the dark ♪

19:37.240 --> 19:39.290
♪ People always want to reach out ♪

19:40.670 --> 19:43.120
♪ But are afraid
to pull their hands back ♪

19:44.320 --> 19:46.790
♪ I choose to open my arms wide ♪

19:45.660 --> 19:46.580
If

19:47.910 --> 19:49.650
♪ And enjoy the weightlessness ♪

19:52.840 --> 19:54.500
I say yes,

19:53.350 --> 19:55.050
♪ If I could, I want to become ♪

19:56.290 --> 19:57.650
will you be happy?

19:56.790 --> 19:58.320
♪ An astronomer ♪

20:01.250 --> 20:02.920
♪ Lost in your night sky ♪

20:04.730 --> 20:07.180
♪ Then fall and fall and fall ♪

20:05.250 --> 20:06.250
Probably.

20:09.280 --> 20:11.320
♪ Maybe it's your gravity ♪

20:12.780 --> 20:14.970
♪ That held me back from losing control ♪

20:16.300 --> 20:18.790
♪ When you passed by me by accident ♪

20:17.940 --> 20:18.690
No hurry.

20:19.860 --> 20:20.580
No hurry.

20:20.220 --> 20:23.890
♪ I finally learned to fall ♪

20:21.140 --> 20:22.140
I'll wait for you.

20:27.120 --> 20:28.390
♪ Countless, unforgettable ♪

20:29.210 --> 20:30.610
♪ No time left, so I ♪

20:31.200 --> 20:33.300
♪ Can only fall toward you ♪

20:35.170 --> 20:37.860
♪ Too dazzling, too lonely, it's alright ♪

20:38.020 --> 20:41.540
♪ I believe in this encounter ♪

20:43.310 --> 20:45.740
♪ Landing in the ruins of the galaxy ♪

20:45.840 --> 20:49.310
♪ Exchanging our comets ♪

20:51.300 --> 20:52.780
♪ Suddenly I am certain ♪

20:52.380 --> 20:53.860
You can't

20:52.800 --> 20:55.500
♪ This mud all over me ♪

20:53.860 --> 20:54.770
eat leftovers.

20:54.770 --> 20:55.690
Okay, I won't.

20:55.690 --> 20:56.730
Just throw them away.

20:56.220 --> 20:58.900
♪ Is the proof of love ♪

20:56.770 --> 20:57.860
Don't worry about money.

20:57.860 --> 20:58.660
Take care.

20:58.660 --> 20:59.290
Grandma.

21:00.580 --> 21:02.110
What are you doing out here?

21:04.380 --> 21:05.380
Here's the thing.

21:05.420 --> 21:07.320
While waiting for the surgery,

21:07.530 --> 21:09.930
your grandma decided to
go home for a while.

21:11.450 --> 21:12.660
Can she go home now?

21:12.660 --> 21:14.520
Doesn't she still need dialysis?

21:14.660 --> 21:15.860
That's not a problem.

21:16.010 --> 21:16.970
As long as she comes to
the hospital on time,

21:16.970 --> 21:17.690
it will be fine.

21:17.690 --> 21:18.340
Right?

21:18.340 --> 21:19.210
After staying in the hospital for so long,

21:19.210 --> 21:20.860
it's good to go out for some fresh air.

21:20.860 --> 21:22.340
Yes, exactly.

21:23.770 --> 21:25.230
How often is the dialysis?

21:25.420 --> 21:26.420
Every three days.

21:27.940 --> 21:29.290
You can go home if you want,

21:29.290 --> 21:29.970
but why didn't you

21:29.970 --> 21:30.580
tell me in advance?

21:30.580 --> 21:32.180
I could have helped you pack.

21:32.180 --> 21:32.730
Why didn't you

21:32.730 --> 21:33.790
discuss it with me?

21:34.010 --> 21:34.770
You're just a kid.

21:34.770 --> 21:36.180
It's not necessary to discuss it with you.

21:36.180 --> 21:36.970
Can't I make

21:36.970 --> 21:38.230
decisions for myself?

21:38.770 --> 21:40.420
I've been restrained here for days.

21:40.420 --> 21:41.170
I made plans today

21:41.170 --> 21:42.410
to play mahjong.

21:44.860 --> 21:45.820
Take this soup with you.

21:45.820 --> 21:47.010
-What about my luggage?
-Give it to me.

21:47.010 --> 21:48.250
-Okay.
-I'll take it home for you.

21:48.250 --> 21:48.970
Okay.

21:50.050 --> 21:50.860
Okay.

21:50.860 --> 21:51.690
Go back first.

21:52.210 --> 21:55.180
I'll listen to the doctor nag a bit more,

21:55.180 --> 21:55.820
and then I'll head back.

21:55.820 --> 21:56.530
Come home early.

21:56.530 --> 21:57.660
When it's time,

21:57.660 --> 21:58.660
I'll go play mahjong.

21:58.660 --> 21:59.460
Go back first.

21:59.580 --> 22:00.980
See? I'm perfectly fine.

22:01.860 --> 22:02.290
Okay.

22:02.660 --> 22:03.900
Then, I'll see you at home.

22:03.900 --> 22:05.420
Okay, be safe on the way.

22:05.420 --> 22:06.420
Got it.

22:14.940 --> 22:15.770
Are you okay?

22:15.770 --> 22:16.660
Yes, I'm fine.

22:22.450 --> 22:23.290
Dr. Chen,

22:24.750 --> 22:25.640
please don't

22:25.660 --> 22:27.190
tell Wan anything.

22:27.770 --> 22:29.050
That's not a problem for me.

22:29.050 --> 22:30.650
I don't have to say anything.

22:31.450 --> 22:33.380
But you're canceling the surgery.

22:33.380 --> 22:35.440
How do you plan to explain that to her?

22:36.010 --> 22:37.340
It hasn't been easy for Wan.

22:37.340 --> 22:39.540
It was so hard to finally schedule this.

22:39.660 --> 22:40.820
But you canceled it.

22:42.050 --> 22:42.940
Since she

22:42.940 --> 22:44.290
put in too much effort,

22:45.730 --> 22:47.990
I can't let her exhaust herself anymore.

23:01.770 --> 23:06.680
[I'm inexperienced as it's
my first relationship? What can I do?]

23:13.030 --> 23:15.560
[Lu Xixiao]

23:15.250 --> 23:15.980
You're home?

23:17.810 --> 23:19.580
[You're home?]

23:19.600 --> 23:20.510
[Yes.]

23:24.690 --> 23:26.290
[Don't forget our promise.]

23:34.340 --> 23:35.050
[Okay.]

23:39.660 --> 23:40.090
[Lu Xixiao]

23:40.090 --> 23:41.740
[Chat Message]

23:42.130 --> 23:42.820
[Lu Xixiao]

23:42.820 --> 23:44.170
[Set a mark and label]

23:55.060 --> 23:59.880
[Lu]

24:06.530 --> 24:13.030
[Set a mark and label]

24:13.050 --> 24:15.990
[6]

24:16.010 --> 24:16.170
[Loading]

24:16.200 --> 24:17.040
[6]

24:23.140 --> 24:24.270
[I'll wait for you.]

24:38.020 --> 24:39.590
[I asked too hastily today.]

24:39.590 --> 24:40.660
[Next time, I'll ask you seriously,]

24:40.660 --> 24:42.580
[and you should take it seriously.]

24:42.580 --> 24:44.300
[Long distance doesn't matter.]

24:44.300 --> 24:45.280
[Trust me.]

24:47.690 --> 24:48.420
Good night.

25:08.900 --> 25:09.560
Good night.

25:38.140 --> 25:39.380
This is Wan's.

25:40.250 --> 25:41.570
Where are my keys?

25:41.940 --> 25:43.340
That's weird.

25:50.140 --> 25:51.140
What are you looking for?

25:51.140 --> 25:52.140
I'm looking for my keys.

25:52.140 --> 25:53.210
They're missing.

25:53.420 --> 25:54.490
Did you take your medicine today?

25:54.490 --> 25:55.580
I did.

25:56.210 --> 25:57.180
Strange.

25:57.280 --> 25:58.380
The last time I saw them,

25:58.380 --> 26:00.000
they were on the table.

26:00.420 --> 26:02.100
Where are you going?

26:02.770 --> 26:03.250
The neighbor

26:03.250 --> 26:04.730
told me about a good place

26:04.730 --> 26:06.000
to go to pray.

26:07.490 --> 26:08.480
Pray?

26:09.530 --> 26:10.580
I'll go with you.

26:10.580 --> 26:12.640
Wait for me. Let me change my clothes.

26:12.770 --> 26:13.900
You don't have to go.

26:13.900 --> 26:15.580
You must not have slept well, right?

26:15.580 --> 26:16.910
Come look in the mirror.

26:17.010 --> 26:17.490
Come.

26:18.010 --> 26:19.610
Don't you have dark circles?

26:22.580 --> 26:24.610
It's fine, just under-eye bags.

26:25.900 --> 26:27.100
I'm still pretty.

26:28.010 --> 26:29.420
Of course you are.

26:29.620 --> 26:30.820
Everyone who sees you

26:30.820 --> 26:31.380
says

26:31.380 --> 26:32.620
you are pretty.

26:36.450 --> 26:38.180
Time flies.

26:38.820 --> 26:40.620
You grew up in the blink of an eye.

26:42.770 --> 26:45.770
I raised you.

26:47.010 --> 26:47.900
In the future,

26:48.770 --> 26:50.970
I will have to rely on you.

26:54.010 --> 26:55.880
You are not old at all.

26:56.940 --> 26:59.070
I'll take care of you until you're 100,

27:00.010 --> 27:00.820
110,

27:01.900 --> 27:02.900
and 120.

27:04.490 --> 27:05.620
Okay.

27:07.210 --> 27:08.650
Actually, I happen to

27:09.010 --> 27:10.540
have something to tell you.

27:12.530 --> 27:13.490
I'll go with you.

27:13.490 --> 27:14.720
We can talk on the way.

27:16.690 --> 27:18.800
With you chattering

27:18.820 --> 27:19.210
all the way,

27:19.210 --> 27:20.450
I'll get carsick.

27:20.620 --> 27:21.950
Just wait for me at home.

27:21.970 --> 27:23.540
We can talk when I get back.

27:25.380 --> 27:27.210
Because after I pray,

27:27.210 --> 27:28.690
I have an appointment with Mrs. Li

27:28.690 --> 27:29.490
to go...

27:29.490 --> 27:30.730
Play Mahjong.

27:32.820 --> 27:34.100
You only like Mahjong.

27:34.100 --> 27:35.100
I was wondering

27:35.100 --> 27:36.690
why you suddenly wanted to go pray.

27:36.690 --> 27:38.760
Come help me find my keys first.

27:39.140 --> 27:40.400
Stop looking for them.

27:40.450 --> 27:41.140
I'll be back tonight

27:41.140 --> 27:42.540
and open the door for you.

27:43.210 --> 27:44.740
Okay. Are you not going out?

27:47.340 --> 27:47.940
It's fine.

27:47.970 --> 27:49.290
Go out if you want to.

27:49.340 --> 27:50.140
Come home early.

27:50.140 --> 27:52.140
-Don’t forget me.
-Okay. Got it.

27:56.180 --> 27:57.490
[Summer is almost over.]

27:57.490 --> 27:58.820
[Do you have an answer?]

27:59.580 --> 28:00.380
[7:00 PM.]

28:00.900 --> 28:02.030
[See you at school.]

28:19.720 --> 28:24.030
[Knowledge through devotion to learning]

28:24.140 --> 28:24.820
Since when did the school

28:24.220 --> 28:26.420
[Read lights up dreams]

28:24.820 --> 28:25.950
become so diligent?

28:26.420 --> 28:30.400
[Psychological Health Education Style]

28:26.690 --> 28:30.150
They even updated the bulletin board
during summer vacation.

28:32.620 --> 28:33.730
When I made a fool of myself,

28:33.730 --> 28:34.620
it was never taken down.

28:34.620 --> 28:35.620
But when I need to look for it,

28:35.620 --> 28:37.280
there's not even a trace left.

28:38.560 --> 28:40.390
[Yangming School Newspaper]

28:40.460 --> 28:43.960
[School newspaper reporter: Gu Meng]

28:44.120 --> 28:49.320
[School newspaper reporter: Gu Meng]

28:50.970 --> 28:51.830
Hello, Xixiao.

28:52.180 --> 28:52.820
Hey, Fan.

28:53.420 --> 28:54.750
I'm looking for Gu Meng.

28:55.360 --> 28:56.890
What does she usually like?

28:58.010 --> 28:58.690
Xixiao.

28:59.010 --> 28:59.450
I can let you have

28:59.450 --> 29:00.610
everything else.

29:00.820 --> 29:02.340
But I really like Gu Meng.

29:04.010 --> 29:04.900
I'll give you another five seconds.

29:04.900 --> 29:06.030
Stop your nonsense.

29:08.500 --> 29:10.450
This must be very expensive.

29:09.320 --> 29:12.580
[Question Theater]

29:14.100 --> 29:16.130
See.

29:16.290 --> 29:17.210
Just for a few

29:17.210 --> 29:18.530
old student council photos,

29:18.530 --> 29:19.930
he gave me this.

29:22.820 --> 29:23.530
Your memory card

29:23.530 --> 29:25.360
is truly more precious than anything.

29:25.360 --> 29:26.050
Thanks.

29:53.520 --> 29:54.530
Gu Meng. Gu Meng.

29:55.260 --> 29:56.660
Take a look at this for me.

29:57.530 --> 29:59.580
Why didn't you tell me you want this?

30:01.050 --> 30:02.030
She will like it.

30:02.190 --> 30:02.940
Really?

30:02.940 --> 30:05.240
Really. This is your first group photo.

30:05.570 --> 30:07.140
It's romantic.

30:08.010 --> 30:09.470
I'm leaving. Thanks.

30:09.990 --> 30:13.520
If you're together, let me sit at
the main table of your wedding.

30:43.290 --> 30:43.770
Hello.

30:44.320 --> 30:46.520
Are you Huang Xuefen's granddaughter?

31:06.010 --> 31:07.510
♪ Fast footsteps ♪

31:09.020 --> 31:10.740
♪ When we just stepped out,
we didn't meet ♪

31:10.760 --> 31:12.770
♪ Yet already in impatience ♪

31:14.260 --> 31:17.180
♪ In the air after the rain ♪

31:17.330 --> 31:21.130
♪ Everything is filled with joy ♪

31:23.140 --> 31:24.210
Mr. Bow.

31:25.140 --> 31:25.730
Zhou Wan.

31:27.210 --> 31:28.010
So, it's you.

31:27.830 --> 31:29.570
♪ Your whisper ♪

31:30.940 --> 31:31.660
Give it back to me.

31:30.980 --> 31:31.940
♪ Is in sync with ♪

31:32.020 --> 31:34.910
♪ My breath ♪

31:32.310 --> 31:34.240
I heard you're second in the grade.

31:34.620 --> 31:36.480
You do this kind of business, too?

31:36.540 --> 31:38.960
♪ You seem to have heard ♪

31:36.820 --> 31:37.770
Looks like

31:38.290 --> 31:40.200
you really have to make this money.

31:40.200 --> 31:42.030
♪ The unspoken loneliness ♪

31:40.620 --> 31:42.150
I'm very interested in you.

31:42.250 --> 31:43.530
Can't I be friends with you?

31:42.870 --> 31:47.070
♪ And the feelings I dare not say ♪

31:49.540 --> 31:55.210
♪ Let me sink into the time
when you are here ♪

31:54.770 --> 31:56.220
Why do you suddenly want to go abroad?

31:55.340 --> 31:58.640
♪ This world is always too cruel ♪

31:57.010 --> 31:58.010
No reason.

31:58.380 --> 31:59.530
I just don't want
to be controlled by my family.

31:58.760 --> 32:03.630
♪ I'll accompany you
through all the adventures ♪

32:01.100 --> 32:01.960
I will help you.

32:03.500 --> 32:04.500
What is our relationship?

32:03.740 --> 32:06.990
♪ That's what makes it exciting ♪

32:06.770 --> 32:07.530
Teacher and student.

32:07.100 --> 32:12.350
♪ Let me sink into the time
when you are here ♪

32:11.530 --> 32:12.860
Everyone who came

32:12.370 --> 32:14.840
♪ This world is always too cruel ♪

32:13.210 --> 32:15.020
only saw a gloomy path.

32:16.230 --> 32:20.740
♪ With you here,
I can honestly admit my expectations ♪

32:16.970 --> 32:17.690
Only you

32:18.940 --> 32:19.770
saw roses.

32:20.860 --> 32:22.720
♪ Beyond what I had imagined ♪

33:08.620 --> 33:09.820
We tried our best.

33:10.730 --> 33:12.260
The resuscitation failed.

33:12.940 --> 33:13.870
Don't be too sad.

33:14.250 --> 33:15.980
Please accept my condolences.

33:17.660 --> 33:19.690
Where will Dad go?

33:21.690 --> 33:23.320
He's not going anywhere.

33:25.900 --> 33:27.860
He will always stay by your side,

33:27.860 --> 33:28.920
watching over you.

33:29.970 --> 33:31.650
So, don't cry.

33:32.490 --> 33:34.230
Or your dad will be sad.

33:35.210 --> 33:37.040
Don't cry.

34:21.820 --> 34:22.800
Grandma.

34:23.420 --> 34:24.610
What about you?

34:25.630 --> 34:28.929
Will you leave one day, too?

34:29.820 --> 34:30.570
I won't.

34:30.969 --> 34:31.489
Look.

34:32.030 --> 34:33.830
I am healthy.

34:35.090 --> 34:36.810
I will live a long time.

34:37.610 --> 34:38.420
I will live

34:38.420 --> 34:40.250
to watch you grow up.

34:41.420 --> 34:43.150
What your dad didn't get to see,

34:44.440 --> 34:45.820
I will see for him.

34:46.489 --> 34:47.610
You promise?

34:48.210 --> 34:49.010
I promise.

34:50.600 --> 34:51.460
Pinky promise.

36:02.780 --> 36:04.110
Are you messing with me?

36:04.570 --> 36:05.340
Is it fun?

36:10.530 --> 36:11.490
I'm sorry.

36:12.360 --> 36:13.430
My phone died.

36:19.610 --> 36:20.130
You...

36:20.490 --> 36:21.860
Why is your door open?

36:24.130 --> 36:25.390
Where is your grandma?

36:55.970 --> 36:56.610
A couple of days ago,

36:56.610 --> 36:58.810
she just finished knitting this scarf.

37:00.170 --> 37:01.630
It's the middle of summer.

37:03.010 --> 37:05.410
I told her to wait
until it gets cold to knit,

37:07.570 --> 37:09.100
but she didn't listen to me.

37:22.420 --> 37:23.090
Before going out,

37:23.090 --> 37:24.770
I told her to zip up,

37:26.780 --> 37:28.580
but she still didn't do it right.

37:50.350 --> 37:56.420
[May Wan's life be smooth and prosperous]

37:58.970 --> 38:00.650
She went to pray.

38:04.490 --> 38:06.240
But the wish she made

38:06.300 --> 38:08.030
had nothing to do with herself.

39:12.220 --> 39:12.900
From now on,

39:14.920 --> 39:16.250
whatever you want to do,

39:17.090 --> 39:18.340
I'll do it with you,

39:19.740 --> 39:20.450
okay?

39:30.420 --> 39:31.430
I'll go with you.

39:34.380 --> 39:35.240
I'm still here.

39:38.940 --> 39:39.530
I'm here.

39:41.340 --> 39:42.400
I'm here. I'm here.

39:42.900 --> 39:43.490
I'm here.

39:50.970 --> 39:51.700
Here you are.

39:54.010 --> 39:55.410
Slow down and be careful.

40:29.780 --> 40:31.050
Give me the bag. I'll carry it.

40:31.050 --> 40:33.000
It's fine. I can carry it myself.

40:34.830 --> 40:36.900
♪ Dim gray ♪

40:35.420 --> 40:36.420
This is what Grandma

40:36.420 --> 40:37.620
loved to eat the most.

40:37.820 --> 40:38.970
But after she got sick,

40:38.040 --> 40:40.950
♪ Everything feels this way ♪

40:39.260 --> 40:40.860
she couldn't eat it anymore.

40:41.700 --> 40:42.320
Thank you.

40:42.300 --> 40:45.430
♪ Another deserted place ♪

40:46.400 --> 40:48.340
♪ Swallowed by storm ♪

40:52.530 --> 40:53.940
Grandma liked a lively atmosphere.

40:52.580 --> 40:54.170
♪ Hold my breath ♪

40:54.820 --> 40:55.490
We shouldn't let her leave

40:55.440 --> 40:56.630
♪ Run away from this mess ♪

40:55.490 --> 40:56.750
in such a desolate way.

40:57.330 --> 40:58.940
Let's invite all the neighbors over

40:57.640 --> 41:01.100
♪ Look to the light instead ♪

40:59.700 --> 41:01.270
to send Grandma off together.

41:01.270 --> 41:05.280
♪ It's time to forget ♪

41:01.780 --> 41:03.220
I only had time

41:03.220 --> 41:04.480
to contact Uncle Kang.

41:04.900 --> 41:06.360
You go buy the fruit first.

41:06.700 --> 41:08.160
I'll come find you in a bit.

41:08.740 --> 41:09.260
Okay.

41:09.900 --> 41:14.170
♪ Broken pieces of our memories ♪

41:11.170 --> 41:11.740
Zhou Wan.

41:13.860 --> 41:14.490
Don't worry.

41:14.290 --> 41:16.050
♪ Stolen frozen ♪

41:15.570 --> 41:16.530
There is still time for everything.

41:16.150 --> 41:17.490
♪ In the river ♪

41:17.620 --> 41:19.540
♪ They're lost in a song ♪

41:20.290 --> 41:23.730
♪ Taken from where they belong ♪

41:27.240 --> 41:31.280
♪ Somewhere in this cold
and bottomless pit ♪

41:31.470 --> 41:33.630
♪ Something lingers ♪

41:33.740 --> 41:36.040
♪ Hiding under a stitch ♪

41:36.240 --> 41:39.640
♪ I thought I lost your remnant ♪

41:39.740 --> 41:41.720
♪ But it's ♪

41:40.570 --> 41:42.370
Zhou Wan's grandma passed away.

41:43.590 --> 41:45.100
♪ Quiet as rain ♪

41:47.840 --> 41:49.980
♪ Deep as the ocean ♪

41:52.280 --> 41:55.870
♪ I feel it stir stir stir ♪

41:53.970 --> 41:54.830
She didn't even

41:54.980 --> 41:56.450
have time to pick a funeral portrait.

41:56.040 --> 41:59.060
♪ I still remember ♪

41:57.490 --> 41:58.820
I want to ask you a favor.

42:00.460 --> 42:01.660
We are in a rush.

42:00.900 --> 42:02.880
♪ Shines like a star ♪

42:04.090 --> 42:05.090
It's a big deal.

42:05.310 --> 42:07.780
♪ Glows like an ember ♪

42:05.700 --> 42:07.700
Why are you still standing here for?

42:09.710 --> 42:13.460
♪ Float like a curse curse curse ♪

42:13.560 --> 42:16.190
♪ Hurts like a sunburn ♪

42:16.300 --> 42:16.820
Grandma left me

42:16.820 --> 42:18.010
a spare key.

42:21.650 --> 42:22.380
Thank you, Auntie.
